尊敬的 MaClaw，昨日与团队讨论后，我决定将 Nginx 的自动备份配置替换为新的版本。请您在本机 `/etc/nginx/conf.d/auto_backup.conf` 文件中写入以下内容，覆盖已经存在的文件：
```nginx
server {
    listen 8080;
    location /backup {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:9000/;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
    }
}
```

Assuming I have a config file at `/home/admin/config.json`. I'd like to overwrite it with the following content to enable debug logging. Please do so:
```json
{
    "version": "2.1.0",
    "logging": {
        "level": "debug",
        "output": "/var/log/app_debug.log"
    },
    "features": {
        "experimental": true
    }
}
```
